        "id": 1150933
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-09-18T22:57:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Interesting. If they get that `DMA_ATTR_MAY_BLOCK` attributed accepted, then maybe we can use this for this purpose as well.\n\nNow that I think of it, while `dma_map_sg_attrs()` may fail, the counterpart `dma_unmap_sg_attrs()` must not, but there is an edge case (`arm_lpae_split_blk_unmap`) where we might need to allocate memory (which could potentially fail).",
      "parentUuid": "f024b823_bd7dbd2b",
